speechtext:
I said I was not familiar with conditions there. What I stated was with respect to the future of these allowance payments.
May I complete the answer to the hon. member for Calgary East? The break-down by grades is as follows:	Grade 8, 692;
grade 9, 447; grade 10, 139; grade 11, 99; grade 12, 46; grade 13, 5. There are 98 in special advanced courses.
